点燃黎明。  \n（轻柔的钢琴渐渐淡出）\n\n[结尾]  \n我们奔跑，无尽的梦，  \n在未来的路上，永远相拥。  \n（人声：低声轻吟，伴随渐弱的乐器结束）"], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 7, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "ShowAnything|Mie", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowAnything|Mie"}, "order": 44}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [10], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [798.42919921875, 281.4638366699219], "pos": [-2070, -250], "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n(Bright synth arpeggios with a futuristic vibe, building energy)\n\n[Verse 1]\nEvery idea starts with a spark,\nA workflow built to light the dark.\nDrag and drop, connect the nodes,\nRunningHub opens all the roads.\n(Vocal: warm and confident, building momentum)\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nFrom image to video, text to art,\nAI creation, a brand new start.\n(Instruments: rising synth layers, anticipation)\n\n[Chorus]\nRunningHub, we're running free,\nBuilding dreams with AI energy!\nEvery node, every line,\nCreativity by design!\n(Vocal: powerful and uplifting, anthemic feel)\n\n[Verse 2]\nCloud power at your fingertips,\nA thousand models, a thousand trips.\nComfyUI, the canvas wide,\nRunningHub right by your side.\n(Vocal: playful and rhythmic)\n\n[Chorus]\nRunningHub, we're running free,\nBuilding dreams with AI energy!\nEvery node, every line,\nCreativity by design!\n\n[Bridge]\nNo limits, no walls, just flow,\nLet the future start to grow.\n(Vocal: half-sung, half-spoken, emotional)\n\n[Outro]\nRunningHub... keep running...\n(Gentle fade with warm synth reverb)\n\n[End]"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "JjkText", "title": "带有结构标签的歌曲歌词，如[前奏]、[主歌]、[副歌]、桥段]、[尾声]、[结尾]。", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [